# --- .NET Build Artifacts (Fixes nested Go globbing) ---
# Direct root targets
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ww]wwroot/
[Vv]irtual[Ff]iles/

# Wildcards for nested project folders (Up to 4 levels deep)
**/[Bb]in/
**/[Oo]bj/
*/**/[Bb]in/
*/**/[Oo]bj/
*/*/**/[Bb]in/
*/*/**/[Oo]bj/

# --- Test & Publish Artifacts ---
**/TestResult*/
**/BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/
**/publish/